WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.389
The twenty-four distribution
point tier is interim,

2
00:00:03.389 --> 00:00:07.350
not a new floor, and five gates
decide when the last one retires.

3
00:00:07.350 --> 00:00:10.056
First, app content:
client apps on Intune and

4
00:00:10.056 --> 00:00:13.363
nothing still deployed from
Configuration Manager.

5
00:00:13.363 --> 00:00:17.963
Second, update content moved, and
the old update setting turned off.

6
00:00:17.963 --> 00:00:22.574
Third, imaging moved from task
sequences to Windows Autopilot.

7
00:00:22.574 --> 00:00:26.525
Fourth, no Connected Cache running
on distribution point hardware.

8
00:00:26.525 --> 00:00:30.475
Fifth, no compliance evidence
sourced from the site database.

9
00:00:30.475 --> 00:00:34.100
Close all five in month thirty
and retire in month thirty.

10
00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:35.750
Still open at month sixty?

11
00:00:35.750 --> 00:00:38.300
Keep the tier rather than force a cutover.
